  "body": "Welcome to this beautifully presented family home, tucked away in a peaceful sun filled, quiet cul-de-sac in one of Devonport's most cherished and tightly held locations.\r\n\r\nThis standalone cedar home, thoughtfully designed to maximise natural light, warmth and year-round comfort, enjoys an open northerly aspect that fills the home with all-day sun. Positioned within this sought-after peaceful village setting, the home is wonderfully sheltered, creating a true suntrap that is warm and inviting throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\nLovingly maintained and beautifully presented, the home offers generous open-plan living spaces where large north-facing windows capture the sunshine and expansive green outlook across established trees and sports fields. With no homes directly opposite, you'll appreciate the sense of openness, privacy and connection to nature.\r\n\r\nThe modern kitchen sits at the heart of the home, flowing effortlessly through the living and dining areas to beautifully landscaped, decked gardens. Private, secure and sheltered, this is an idyllic setting for entertaining family and friends or simply relaxing in your own peaceful haven.\r\n\r\nDesigned with flexibility in mind, the home offers adaptable accommodation, including the option of a bedroom on the lower level and a bathroom on each floor—perfect for families, guests, teenagers or those seeking multi-generational living. Two well-appointed bathrooms, a separate laundry and excellent storage provide everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nA real rarity in Devonport is the internal access garage with additional storage, offering convenience and functionality that's increasingly hard to find.\r\n\r\nBeyond the home itself, the lifestyle is exceptional. It's an easy 10-minute walk to Devonport Village, beautiful beaches, schools and the ferry, while the golf course, sports fields and the cycleway through to Takapuna are all close by. Whether it's a morning walk to the beach, coffee in the village or an easy commute to the city, everything is within easy reach.\r\n\r\nAdding to the appeal is the wonderful sense of community. Friendly neighbours have chosen to stay for many years, creating a welcoming, stable neighbourhood where children can safely play and residents enjoy the quiet, low-traffic surroundings.\r\n\r\nA hidden gem and a rare find in Devonport, this much-loved home combines low-maintenance living with exceptional functionality, warmth and privacy—qualities that are increasingly difficult to find. Having been cherished by its current owner, it now offers an exciting opportunity for the next family to enjoy everything this special home and location have to offer.",
